try":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.8205769,36.44816974]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"壬生町城址公園","category":"nature","address":"下都賀郡壬生町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"09361","municipality_pref":"栃木県","municipality_name":"壬生町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.7979883,36.42742679]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"みぶハイウェーパーク","category":"nature","address":"下都賀郡壬生町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"09361","municipality_pref":"栃木県","municipality_name":"壬生町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.80769535,36.45517012]}}],"display_comment_original":"壬生町には、江戸期の上田（下野）藩と上田陣屋に連なる領主・城下の記憶が残る。 この地域には古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、壬生城跡、羽生田城跡、富士山古墳のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、藤井村、下稲葉村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。上田（下野）藩ゆかりの領主碑や旧領境を示すしるべにも期待できる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["壬生綱房","壬生徳雪斎"],"notable_people":["壬生綱房","壬生徳雪斎","円仁","鯉沼九八郎","森田仲造"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["壬生寺","雄琴神社","愛宕神社","興生寺","豊栖院","精忠神社","興光寺","縄解地蔵尊"],"specialties":["かんぴょう、いちご、ごぼう、切り花、薬草","サビかん"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":["壬生藩"],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["壬生町史 資料編 原始古代・中世 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-9644234"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A3%AC%E7%94%9F%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11429511","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11429497","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q732282","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11674241","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11540036","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11401255","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2658543","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%A3%AC%E7%94%9F%E7%B6%B1%E6%88%BF&keyword=%E5%A3%AC%E7%94%9F%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"壬生町","wikipedia_revisio